WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.820
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.090 --> 01:43.970
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.170 --> 01:46.850
[Episode 16]

4
01:46.560 --> 01:48.200
"Yearning"

5
01:48.950 --> 01:50.710
by Li Bai from the Tang Dynasty.

6
01:51.310 --> 01:54.400
Fresh autumn breeze, bright autumn moon.

7
01:54.950 --> 01:57.810
Fallen leaves gather and scatter around the trees;

8
01:58.039 --> 02:01.100
Cold-stricken crows soon fall asleep and wake as soon.

9
02:01.280 --> 02:04.280
When will we meet again? I long for you so much.

10
02:04.840 --> 02:07.480
-This moment, this night, is so agonizing. -What brings you two here?

11
02:07.480 --> 02:10.190
Um, do you have security cameras here?

12
02:10.590 --> 02:11.630
The hospital footage shows

13
02:11.630 --> 02:13.360
that he left at 6:42.

14
02:13.360 --> 02:15.310
Your camera faces the hospital entrance.

15
02:15.310 --> 02:17.190
Let's start looking from 6:42 onward,

16
02:17.190 --> 02:18.000
right?

17
02:18.150 --> 02:19.280
See whether he left alone

18
02:19.280 --> 02:20.470
or was picked up,

19
02:20.470 --> 02:21.150
and whether he walked

20
02:21.150 --> 02:22.280
or got into a car.

21
02:22.680 --> 02:23.210
Alright.

22
02:24.280 --> 02:25.280
6:42, right?

23
02:25.560 --> 02:27.520
Let's start from here then.

24
02:27.550 --> 02:31.050
[Camera 01] [Camera 02]

25
02:28.400 --> 02:30.520
Drag the timeline forward a little

26
02:30.520 --> 02:31.650
and speed it up a bit.

27
02:33.630 --> 02:37.900
[Prosperous Dynasty]

28
02:34.310 --> 02:35.120
Is that him?

29
02:35.470 --> 02:35.910
Hey, that one, that one.

30
02:35.910 --> 02:36.630
That's him.

31
02:38.190 --> 02:39.630
Hold on. Pause, pause.

32
02:39.420 --> 02:43.600
[Prosperous Dynasty]

33
02:40.750 --> 02:42.360
Look, Bus No. 107.

34
02:43.690 --> 02:44.900
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

35
02:48.710 --> 02:50.430
We've reached Li's son.

36
02:50.520 --> 02:51.960
He said Li never made it home,

37
02:51.960 --> 02:52.870
and they don't have any relatives

38
02:52.870 --> 02:54.560
living along the No. 107 bus route.

39
02:54.560 --> 02:55.840
Based on the direction Li was traveling,

40
02:55.840 --> 02:57.470
there should be 6 more stops.

41
02:57.680 --> 02:59.240
We'll have to check with people at each stop, one by one.

42
02:58.530 --> 02:59.720
[Old Mill Housing Complex]

43
03:05.390 --> 03:07.610
[Old Mill Housing Complex] [107]

44
03:06.710 --> 03:08.280
He was wearing a hospital gown

45
03:08.280 --> 03:09.080
and got off Bus No. 107.

46
03:09.080 --> 03:10.000
Ring any bells?

47
03:13.370 --> 03:16.820
[Next Stop: Tuyingqiao]

48
03:18.400 --> 03:19.190
Hello, sir.

49
03:19.280 --> 03:19.710
Excuse me,

50
03:19.710 --> 03:21.170
but have you seen this man?

51
03:21.680 --> 03:22.430
About this tall,

52
03:22.430 --> 03:22.960
wearing blue.

53
03:22.960 --> 03:24.290
Can I ask you something?

54
03:24.800 --> 03:26.310
About 1.8 meters tall.

55
03:26.470 --> 03:27.190
Thank you.

56
03:29.150 --> 03:30.680
North of Jianping Factory,

57
03:30.910 --> 03:32.040
east of the bus stop.

58
03:32.150 --> 03:33.210
Let's all meet up there.

59
03:33.210 --> 03:35.260
[Erligou Pass]

60
03:35.320 --> 03:37.560
[Next Stop: Jianping Factory]

61
03:52.000 --> 03:52.800
Uncle Li!

62
03:53.310 --> 03:54.120
Stop!

63
03:55.360 --> 03:57.020
I'm from Xiaoximen Hospital.

64
03:57.310 --> 03:59.970
I've been looking for you all morning, Uncle Li.

65
04:04.680 --> 04:06.400
Um, Uncle Li.

66
04:06.710 --> 04:08.240
I'm from Xiaoximen Hospital.

67
04:08.240 --> 04:11.520
I used to work at this Jianping Factory.

68
04:13.630 --> 04:15.630
Back when the factory was thriving,

69
04:16.390 --> 04:18.070
they built 2 railway lines

70
04:18.750 --> 04:19.880
to transport goods.

71
04:21.800 --> 04:22.680
And every day,

72
04:24.040 --> 04:26.190
I'd sit in this little shack

73
04:27.040 --> 04:28.430
and operate

74
04:29.000 --> 04:31.090
this railway turntable.

75
04:31.480 --> 04:32.680
So you're revisiting your old stomping grounds,

76
04:32.680 --> 04:35.070
reminiscing about the good old days, huh?

77
04:42.750 --> 04:44.360
It was 1988.

78
04:46.560 --> 04:49.090
I wanted to go to Shenyang to start a business,

79
04:50.390 --> 04:52.120
but my dad wouldn't hear of it.

80
04:54.000 --> 04:54.630
He even

81
04:54.630 --> 04:56.070
pulled some strings

82
04:57.390 --> 04:59.480
to get me a job at Jianping Factory.

83
05:01.390 --> 05:02.190
Every day,

84
05:02.950 --> 05:03.830
I'd just

85
05:03.830 --> 05:05.310
sit in this little shack,

86
05:06.480 --> 05:08.800
operating this railway turntable,

87
05:08.800 --> 05:10.400
turning it this way and that.

88
05:11.600 --> 05:13.070
Back then, I thought

89
05:14.830 --> 05:15.960
I had it pretty good.

90
05:18.600 --> 05:19.800
But looking back now,

91
05:21.310 --> 05:23.000
I actually wasted my life.

92
05:25.240 --> 05:26.630
What a waste of life.

93
05:27.800 --> 05:28.870
I let myself go,

94
05:29.920 --> 05:31.920
and then the factory went bankrupt.

95
05:33.070 --> 05:33.750
If I could

96
05:36.040 --> 05:37.510
live my life over,

97
05:39.240 --> 05:40.120
I'd definitely

98
05:40.120 --> 05:41.360
follow my own ideas,

99
05:41.360 --> 05:43.510
turn my own turntable,

100
05:43.920 --> 05:46.120
and choose the path I wanted to take.

101
05:47.000 --> 05:47.800
No matter what,

102
05:47.800 --> 05:49.560
I wouldn't end up like this—

103
05:49.560 --> 05:50.950
in my sixties

104
05:50.950 --> 05:52.480
with absolutely nothing to look forward to,

105
05:52.480 --> 05:53.810
just filled with regret

106
05:54.430 --> 05:56.310
every single day.

107
05:56.560 --> 05:59.020
Uncle Li, things aren't so bad now, are they?

108
06:02.480 --> 06:03.160
Dad!

109
06:03.480 --> 06:05.190
Why are you wandering around in this freezing cold?

110
06:05.190 --> 06:06.600
What if you pass out from the cold?

111
06:06.600 --> 06:07.120
Come on,

112
06:07.560 --> 06:08.110
let's get you back to the hospital.

113
06:08.110 --> 06:08.870
Son.

114
06:11.360 --> 06:12.830
I lied.

115
06:14.360 --> 06:17.000
I don't have Alzheimer's at all.

116
06:21.600 --> 06:22.870
I just wanted you two

117
06:22.870 --> 06:24.750
to pay a little more attention to me.

118
06:24.750 --> 06:26.240
That's why I...

119
06:26.430 --> 06:27.890
That's why I said all that.

120
06:30.600 --> 06:31.390
I know.

121
06:33.360 --> 06:34.270
You know?

122
06:36.190 --> 06:37.320
Xiaohong knows too.

123
06:41.430 --> 06:42.510
So you two...

124
06:43.430 --> 06:45.390
You two have been

125
06:46.070 --> 06:47.360
playing along with me this whole time?

126
06:47.360 --> 06:48.720
Dad, we only

127
06:48.720 --> 06:50.120
figured it out recently.

128
06:50.560 --> 06:52.870
Xiaohong said we shouldn't tell you yet

129
06:53.000 --> 06:55.430
b-because she was worried you'd feel embarrassed.

130
06:55.430 --> 06:56.680
Dad, it's okay.

131
06:57.240 --> 06:59.640
It's better to be healthy than sick, right?

132
07:01.720 --> 07:02.520
You're right.

133
07:05.160 --> 07:07.160
It's better to be healthy than sick.

134
07:10.480 --> 07:11.270
My son.

135
07:12.750 --> 07:14.430
I've had time to think it over,

136
07:15.240 --> 07:16.700
and I've come to my senses.

137
07:18.070 --> 07:18.870
I

138
07:20.190 --> 07:20.920
really shouldn't have

139
07:20.920 --> 07:22.580
given you two such a hard time,

140
07:23.430 --> 07:25.040
let alone accused you of

141
07:25.040 --> 07:27.170
being unfilial in front of the doctor.

142
07:29.360 --> 07:31.390
Deep down, I know better than anyone

143
07:31.390 --> 07:32.430
that you two are the most filial

144
07:32.430 --> 07:33.830
of all.

145
07:38.240 --> 07:39.040
Alright.

146
07:39.430 --> 07:40.240
Let's go home.

147
07:41.270 --> 07:43.159
Apologize to Xiaohong for me.

148
07:43.800 --> 07:44.360
Dad.

149
07:45.310 --> 07:47.510
Let's go back to the hospital, alright?

150
07:48.630 --> 07:49.270
Okay.

151
07:50.120 --> 07:51.320
Back to the hospital.

152
07:57.600 --> 07:58.560
Sorry

153
07:59.190 --> 08:01.800
for causing you so much trouble.

154
08:02.190 --> 08:02.750
It's okay.

155
08:02.750 --> 08:03.750
It's okay, Uncle Li.

156
08:03.750 --> 08:04.600
Let's go back.

157
08:05.070 --> 08:05.950
Be careful. Careful.

158
08:05.950 --> 08:06.720
I'm fine. Don't worry.

159
08:06.720 --> 08:07.920
Be careful. Careful.

160
08:10.480 --> 08:11.540
-Dad. -Be careful.

161
08:12.800 --> 08:15.260
Honestly, I'm even more scared than you are.

162
08:16.000 --> 08:17.390
I've already lost Mom.

163
08:18.750 --> 08:20.610
I can't afford to lose you as well.

164
08:21.240 --> 08:22.570
I'm here for you, my son.

165
08:24.120 --> 08:25.650
I've never amounted to much

166
08:27.070 --> 08:28.390
in my life.

167
08:29.160 --> 08:31.390
The one thing I can be proud of,

168
08:31.390 --> 08:33.049
the one thing I can brag about,

169
08:33.669 --> 08:34.390
is raising

170
08:34.390 --> 08:35.789
a son as wonderful as you.

171
08:37.030 --> 08:39.440
You've made more of yourself than I ever did,

172
08:39.440 --> 08:41.440
and you're a better person than I am.

173
08:52.080 --> 08:52.880
What's wrong?

174
09:02.790 --> 09:04.200
Ai Chen, where are you going?

175
09:04.200 --> 09:06.490
[Heping Road]

176
09:04.600 --> 09:07.030
I borrowed that e-bike! I've got to return it!

177
09:07.030 --> 09:09.720
If I could live my life over,

178
09:10.240 --> 09:11.120
I'd definitely

179
09:11.120 --> 09:12.360
follow my own ideas

180
09:12.360 --> 09:14.360
and turn my own turntable.

181
09:14.360 --> 09:15.120
No matter what,

182
09:15.120 --> 09:16.910
I wouldn't end up like this—

183
09:16.910 --> 09:18.240
in my sixties

184
09:18.240 --> 09:19.750
with absolutely nothing to look forward to,

185
09:19.750 --> 09:21.080
just filled with regret

186
09:21.720 --> 09:23.550
every single day.

187
09:23.550 --> 09:24.870
Here's what I believe:

188
09:24.910 --> 09:26.170
If you like something,

189
09:26.600 --> 09:27.550
go for it;

190
09:27.550 --> 09:29.350
if you go for it, give it your all;

191
09:29.510 --> 09:30.960
and if you give it your all,

192
09:30.960 --> 09:32.360
you'll leave no regrets.

193
09:36.230 --> 09:37.450
[Friendly Reminder: Non-Motorized Vehicle Parking Area]

194
09:39.590 --> 09:40.940
[Friendly Reminder: Non-Motorized Vehicle Parking Area]

195
09:44.850 --> 09:49.370
[Fucheng North Station]

196
09:49.410 --> 09:51.100
[Ticket Sales Closed] [Station Service Hotline]

197
09:56.840 --> 09:57.440
Hello.

198
09:57.440 --> 09:58.630
Hello, I'd like a ticket

199
09:58.630 --> 10:02.230
to the provincial capital on the earliest available departure.

200
10:03.080 --> 10:03.910
Excuse me.

201
10:12.030 --> 10:12.790
Hello?

202
10:13.910 --> 10:15.240
What's up? Playing mahjong?

203
10:15.240 --> 10:15.960
Alright, Mom, hurry up

204
10:15.960 --> 10:17.020
and book me a flight

205
10:17.120 --> 10:19.080
from the provincial capital to Fuzhou.

206
10:19.080 --> 10:20.150
Got it.

207
10:21.720 --> 10:22.360
What?

208
10:23.200 --> 10:23.930
Buy you what?

209
10:24.480 --> 10:25.410
A flight ticket?

210
10:26.390 --> 10:27.750
I'm on the train

211
10:27.870 --> 10:29.930
to the provincial capital right now.

212
10:31.200 --> 10:32.200
I've thought it through.

213
10:32.200 --> 10:33.930
I need to go see Liu Zhengliang.

214
10:34.390 --> 10:35.150
I'm doing this for myself,

215
10:35.150 --> 10:35.960
not for him.

216
10:37.630 --> 10:38.510
I was thinking,

217
10:38.870 --> 10:40.390
don't you think we need to clear things up

218
10:40.390 --> 10:41.750
between us?

219
10:42.320 --> 10:43.270
Once I'm there,

220
10:43.270 --> 10:44.440
no matter how things turn out,

221
10:44.440 --> 10:46.440
at least I won't have any regrets, right?

222
10:46.440 --> 10:47.320
But

223
10:47.550 --> 10:48.720
everything I told you that day

224
10:48.720 --> 10:50.200
was how I truly felt.

225
10:50.200 --> 10:51.510
That definitely won't change.

226
10:51.510 --> 10:52.670
Don't worry.

227
10:52.870 --> 10:53.720
Sweetheart.

228
10:54.200 --> 10:55.390
I understand.

229
10:55.720 --> 10:57.850
You've got my unconditional support.

230
11:00.390 --> 11:02.000
Put the mahjong on pause. I've got an important announcement.

231
11:02.000 --> 11:03.440
But we had a big win going.

232
11:03.870 --> 11:05.720
If we stop now, you've got to pay up.

233
11:05.720 --> 11:07.520
Our daughter is going to Fuzhou.

234
11:07.790 --> 11:08.630
What's she going

235
11:08.630 --> 11:09.840
all the way out there for?

236
11:09.840 --> 11:11.700
To see Liu Zhengliang, of course.

237
11:13.000 --> 11:14.240
Zhao, we're calling it a day.

238
11:14.240 --> 11:14.910
Alright then.

239
11:14.910 --> 11:15.480
Xiaozhu,

240
11:15.480 --> 11:16.670
hurry and book your sis a flight

241
11:16.670 --> 11:18.270
from the provincial capital to Fuzhou.

242
11:18.270 --> 11:19.080
Within the next 3 hours.

243
11:19.080 --> 11:20.410
The sooner, the better.

244
11:20.960 --> 11:21.720
San,

245
11:22.120 --> 11:24.120
pack some clothes for Ai Chen.

246
11:24.240 --> 11:25.790
She didn't take anything with her.

247
11:25.790 --> 11:27.630
Let's mail them to her right away.

248
11:27.630 --> 11:28.510
Sweetheart.

249
11:29.510 --> 11:31.710
If you run into any trouble on the plane,

250
11:31.720 --> 11:32.840
don't be shy.

251
11:33.480 --> 11:34.790
Just ask for help.

252
11:36.550 --> 11:37.790
Don't turn off your phone.

253
11:37.790 --> 11:39.000
When you see Liu Zhengliang,

254
11:39.000 --> 11:40.200
give me a call.

255
11:40.240 --> 11:42.120
Got it. Don't worry.

256
11:42.120 --> 11:43.720
Just wait for me to come back.

257
11:44.360 --> 11:45.600
Mom, you're the best.

258
11:51.840 --> 11:52.600
Doctor.

259
11:53.870 --> 11:56.480
A-Am I going to be okay?

260
11:57.120 --> 11:57.910
You are.

261
11:58.150 --> 11:59.030
Don't worry.

262
11:59.270 --> 12:00.130
You'll be fine.

263
12:02.870 --> 12:03.670
Don't worry.

264
12:13.960 --> 12:14.750
Let's begin.

265
12:45.510 --> 12:47.170
Balloon catheter, size four.

266
12:58.600 --> 13:00.000
Balloon is in position.

267
13:00.150 --> 13:01.150
Begin inflation.

268
13:18.150 --> 13:19.550
The patient's heart has stopped!

269
13:19.550 --> 13:21.480
Deflate the balloon immediately.

270
13:21.510 --> 13:23.630
Administer 1 milligram of atropine intravenously!

271
13:23.630 --> 13:24.440
Li?

272
13:25.600 --> 13:26.390
Li?

273
13:27.510 --> 13:28.320
Li?

274
13:28.720 --> 13:29.510
Li?

275
13:29.600 --> 13:30.600
Can you hear me?

276
13:30.600 --> 13:31.360
Li?

277
13:31.390 --> 13:33.390
Li, are you feeling any discomfort?

278
13:33.790 --> 13:35.200
Li, don't fall asleep.

279
13:35.320 --> 13:36.120
Li.

280
13:36.440 --> 13:37.750
Stay with us, Li.

281
13:41.000 --> 13:42.320
Cough, cough, Li.

282
13:43.200 --> 13:44.030
Cough a bit.

283
13:45.630 --> 13:47.600
Alright. You're okay.

284
13:50.440 --> 13:51.790
The patient's heartbeat is back to normal.

285
13:51.790 --> 13:53.050
Resume the procedure.

286
13:58.510 --> 13:59.510
Pass me the stent.

287
14:00.030 --> 14:02.320
♪ Walk a mile or two down the road ♪

288
14:03.120 --> 14:05.620
♪ Past four or five homes in a village ♪

289
14:07.630 --> 14:10.030
♪ Beyond eight or nine pavilions ♪

290
14:11.200 --> 14:16.960
♪ Ten or so branches lead to the west wing ♪

291
14:17.870 --> 14:20.390
♪ How do I get to the west wing? ♪

292
14:20.870 --> 14:27.240
♪ The west wing lies just beyond one wall ♪

293
15:09.720 --> 15:14.740
[Fujian Kangtaierke Hospital]

294
15:27.480 --> 15:28.480
What are you up to?

295
15:29.000 --> 15:30.260
Are you busy right now?

296
15:30.720 --> 15:32.580
Go ahead. I'm free for the moment.

297
15:37.150 --> 15:39.240
Well, come downstairs.

298
15:39.720 --> 15:40.960
I'm outside your workplace.

299
15:40.960 --> 15:42.510
What? What workplace?

300
15:44.000 --> 15:44.270
Bro.

301
15:44.270 --> 15:45.550
Put your phone away.

302
15:45.550 --> 15:47.680
The roller coaster's about to depart.

303
15:48.080 --> 15:48.870
Hello?

304
15:50.200 --> 15:51.930
Speak louder. I can't hear you.

305
15:53.720 --> 15:55.120
Hurry up.

306
15:55.910 --> 15:56.720
I'm right outside

307
15:56.720 --> 15:58.510
the hospital where you work in Fuzhou.

308
15:58.510 --> 15:59.480
What are you doing in Fuzhou?

309
15:59.480 --> 16:00.480
I'm not in Fuzhou.

310
16:00.870 --> 16:02.790
What kind of question is that? I'm here to see you, of course.

311
16:02.790 --> 16:03.910
I'm in Bengbu.

312
16:05.150 --> 16:06.200
What? What do you mean?

313
16:06.200 --> 16:07.360
Hurry, hurry. Put it away. Come on.

314
16:07.360 --> 16:09.320
-We're about to depart. Hurry. -Aren't you at

315
16:09.320 --> 16:10.670
this... what's it called? Kang... Kangertai Hospital in Fuzhou?

316
16:10.670 --> 16:11.480
The signal's bad here.

317
16:11.480 --> 16:12.120
I can't hear you.

318
16:12.120 --> 16:13.720
You don't work here anymore?

319
16:18.120 --> 16:19.260
Why are you yelling?

320
16:32.360 --> 16:34.290
You aren't being bullied, are you?

321
16:40.460 --> 16:41.520
[If you're not wearing an employee ID card, please place your bag]

322
16:41.520 --> 16:43.130
[through the security scanner and walk through the security gate. Thank you.]

323
17:24.030 --> 17:24.829
Hello,

324
17:25.349 --> 17:26.640
are you the one looking for Liu Zhengliang?

325
17:26.640 --> 17:28.240
Yes, that would be me. Hello.

326
17:28.510 --> 17:29.960
Pardon me. Well,

327
17:30.790 --> 17:32.070
does Dr. Liu Zhengliang

328
17:32.070 --> 17:33.240
work here?

329
17:33.510 --> 17:34.310
I asked the front desk,

330
17:34.310 --> 17:35.750
but they said there's no such person.

331
17:35.750 --> 17:36.410
Well, yeah.

332
17:36.960 --> 17:38.960
What's your relationship with him?

333
17:38.960 --> 17:39.830
I'm his friend.

334
17:40.310 --> 17:41.200
He was supposed to

335
17:41.200 --> 17:42.640
come work here,

336
17:42.640 --> 17:44.110
but due to circumstances beyond his control,

337
17:44.110 --> 17:45.040
he never made it.

338
17:45.830 --> 17:47.200
What do you mean by "circumstances beyond his control?"

339
17:47.200 --> 17:48.830
Just some special circumstances.

340
17:48.830 --> 17:51.290
But it had nothing to do with Liu Zhengliang.

341
17:52.070 --> 17:52.880
Alright then.

342
17:55.110 --> 17:56.310
What a mess.

343
17:57.240 --> 17:57.920
Do you know

344
17:57.920 --> 17:59.200
where he is now?

345
17:59.440 --> 18:01.030
I'm afraid I don't.

346
18:01.110 --> 18:02.110
I've only been in touch with him

347
18:02.110 --> 18:03.110
over the phone.

348
18:04.310 --> 18:05.510
Alright, thanks.

349
18:05.590 --> 18:06.270
You're welcome.

350
18:06.270 --> 18:07.030
Okay.

351
18:07.510 --> 18:08.310
Hold on.

352
18:09.070 --> 18:09.920
There's something

353
18:09.920 --> 18:11.510
that seems to belong to Dr. Liu.

354
18:11.510 --> 18:13.110
Why don't you take it for him?

355
18:13.240 --> 18:14.000
What is it?

356
18:14.400 --> 18:15.200
Wait here for a moment.

357
18:15.200 --> 18:16.400
I'll go get it for you.

358
18:16.920 --> 18:17.780
Take your time.

359
18:20.160 --> 18:20.960
What a ride.

360
18:22.030 --> 18:22.830
Thrilling!

361
18:30.880 --> 18:31.790
You startled me.

362
18:31.790 --> 18:32.470
The ride's over.

363
18:32.470 --> 18:34.270
Please unfasten your seatbelt.

364
18:34.400 --> 18:36.790
Take your belongings and don't leave anything behind.

365
18:36.790 --> 18:37.510
Double-check

366
18:37.510 --> 18:38.960
your personal belongings.

367
18:38.960 --> 18:40.620
Don't leave anything behind.

368
18:40.790 --> 18:41.790
Where's my phone?

369
18:42.830 --> 18:44.510
Didn't you put it in your pocket?

370
18:44.510 --> 18:46.170
Go down the stairs on the left.

371
18:46.830 --> 18:47.880
Watch your step.

372
18:48.270 --> 18:49.730
This way. This way please.

373
18:52.640 --> 18:53.700
I dropped my phone.

374
19:08.920 --> 19:09.720
Found it.

375
19:11.000 --> 19:11.750
Let me see.

376
19:16.350 --> 19:17.160
How is it?

377
19:30.920 --> 19:32.050
My job fell through,

378
19:33.350 --> 19:34.610
and my luggage's gone.

379
19:35.790 --> 19:36.750
I've got nothing on me

380
19:36.750 --> 19:38.610
except this phone, and I broke it.

381
19:53.960 --> 19:54.750
Wait.

382
19:56.160 --> 19:58.240
Bro, a-are you okay?

383
20:00.880 --> 20:02.070
Am I okay?

384
20:03.830 --> 20:05.350
Do I look okay to you?

385
20:11.960 --> 20:13.490
Was the roller coaster fun?

386
20:14.720 --> 20:15.580
Was it fun, huh?

387
20:16.680 --> 20:17.550
Why did you have to ride it?

388
20:17.550 --> 20:19.350
What's so great about it anyway!

389
20:23.310 --> 20:24.110
Stop yelling!

390
20:26.680 --> 20:27.940
Why are you blaming me?

391
20:29.070 --> 20:30.030
Didn't I remind you

392
20:30.030 --> 20:31.240
to put your phone away

393
20:31.270 --> 20:32.350
before the ride started?

394
20:32.350 --> 20:33.680
I told you to put it away,

395
20:33.720 --> 20:36.580
but you wouldn't listen. And now you're blaming me?

396
20:53.000 --> 20:55.460
I'm laughing so hard I'm about to split a gut.

397
21:06.000 --> 21:06.830
You're right.

398
21:09.310 --> 21:10.570
Why should I blame you?

399
21:13.880 --> 21:15.540
I've only got myself to blame.

400
21:18.830 --> 21:19.830
It's all my fault.

401
21:20.880 --> 21:21.680
I shouldn't have come here

402
21:21.680 --> 21:22.740
in the first place.

403
21:24.920 --> 21:25.720
No, wait.

404
21:28.880 --> 21:29.640
I shouldn't have studied medicine

405
21:29.640 --> 21:30.960
in the first place.

406
21:34.640 --> 21:36.300
If I hadn't studied medicine,

407
21:37.880 --> 21:39.880
I wouldn't have performed surgery.

408
21:41.000 --> 21:42.730
If I hadn't performed surgery,

409
21:44.110 --> 21:45.640
I wouldn't have been fired.

410
21:48.790 --> 21:50.050
If I hadn't been fired,

411
21:51.240 --> 21:52.970
I wouldn't have gone back home.

412
21:55.000 --> 21:56.460
If I hadn't gone back home,

413
21:59.510 --> 22:01.110
I wouldn't have ended up at Xiaoximen Hospital,

414
22:01.110 --> 22:03.110
dealing with that bunch of weirdos.

415
22:05.960 --> 22:09.020
Then I wouldn't be in this embarrassing mess right now.

416
22:20.000 --> 22:20.830
Wait.

417
22:21.720 --> 22:22.440
Bro.

418
22:24.160 --> 22:24.960
It's my fault.

419
22:25.440 --> 22:26.300
Blame me, okay?

420
22:26.920 --> 22:28.050
Don't get worked up.

421
22:29.200 --> 22:30.460
C-Calm down, alright?

422
22:53.550 --> 22:54.350
Let's go.

423
23:00.160 --> 23:00.920
Wait.

424
23:03.880 --> 23:04.940
Where are we going?

425
23:05.030 --> 23:06.110
To fix my phone.

426
23:09.030 --> 23:09.830
Perfect.

427
23:10.270 --> 23:11.200
I've got a friend

428
23:11.240 --> 23:12.440
who fixes phones.

429
23:12.880 --> 23:13.680
Don't worry.

430
23:13.960 --> 23:15.270
I'll make sure he

431
23:15.270 --> 23:16.530
gets your phone fixed.

432
23:16.880 --> 23:17.830
That's great.

433
23:20.960 --> 23:22.420
So you're not mad anymore?

434
23:22.830 --> 23:23.640
Childish.

435
23:24.110 --> 23:25.750
What's the point of getting mad?

436
23:25.750 --> 23:27.440
It won't solve anything.

437
23:28.960 --> 23:30.110
Really? You've calmed down for real?

438
23:30.110 --> 23:30.960
Sure.

439
23:33.960 --> 23:34.550
Great.

440
23:34.550 --> 23:35.510
Then... Then how about

441
23:35.510 --> 23:37.400
a ride on the pirate ship before we go?

442
23:37.400 --> 23:39.460
You think you can push your luck, huh?

443
23:41.160 --> 23:43.360
"You think you can push your luck, huh?"

444
23:43.680 --> 23:44.400
Don't even get me started, Mom.

445
23:44.400 --> 23:45.680
My legs are killing me,

446
23:45.720 --> 23:47.270
and I didn't even get to see him.

447
23:47.270 --> 23:49.880
Apparently, he's gone to Bengbu.

448
23:51.510 --> 23:52.550
Bengbu?

449
23:53.440 --> 23:54.480
I've got no idea.

450
23:54.510 --> 23:55.640
Look it up, will you?

451
23:56.960 --> 23:58.680
Xiaozhu, help me check

452
23:58.680 --> 24:00.790
the train tickets from Fuzhou to Bengbu.

453
24:00.790 --> 24:01.830
Bengbu?

454
24:02.350 --> 24:03.080
Sweetheart,

455
24:03.720 --> 24:05.120
it's getting late today.

456
24:05.400 --> 24:07.720
You might not be able to get a train ticket today.

457
24:07.720 --> 24:09.320
Why don't you find somewhere

458
24:10.030 --> 24:11.200
t-to stay for the night

459
24:11.200 --> 24:13.200
and figure something out tomorrow?

460
24:13.830 --> 24:16.290
Don't forget to charge your phone, alright?

461
24:19.440 --> 24:20.510
Where's Bengbu?

462
24:20.590 --> 24:21.240
In Henan.

463
24:23.110 --> 24:24.510
I think it's in Shandong.

464
24:24.720 --> 24:25.790
It's in Anhui.

465
24:26.790 --> 24:27.590
Wait,

466
24:27.960 --> 24:29.920
why's she going to Anhui now?

467
24:29.920 --> 24:31.780
To see Liu Zhengliang, of course.

468
24:32.400 --> 24:33.720
That Liu Zhengliang—

469
24:34.510 --> 24:36.070
he's in his thirties.

470
24:36.240 --> 24:38.000
yet he has no car, no house,

471
24:38.550 --> 24:39.400
no money,

472
24:39.750 --> 24:41.880
a-and no emotional intelligence.

473
24:42.400 --> 24:43.270
Why on earth would our daughter

474
24:43.270 --> 24:45.310
go all the way out there to see him?

475
24:46.550 --> 24:47.550
What did you have when I got together with you

476
24:47.550 --> 24:48.440
back then?

477
24:57.440 --> 24:58.270
I had love.

478
25:03.480 --> 25:04.440
That's true.

479
25:04.540 --> 25:07.770
[Cell Phone Repair][Screen Replacement]

480
25:08.030 --> 25:08.640
Here.

481
25:15.160 --> 25:16.590
How much longer do you need?

482
25:16.590 --> 25:18.110
Almost done. Easy, easy.

483
25:23.030 --> 25:24.720
Bro, passions. Passions.

484
25:25.880 --> 25:27.030
Look at you,

485
25:27.160 --> 25:28.440
speaking English.

486
25:28.550 --> 25:30.640
"Passions?" You mean "patience."

487
25:32.720 --> 25:33.510
Right.

488
25:33.550 --> 25:34.440
If I'm happy,

489
25:34.440 --> 25:36.170
I can even speak bird language.

490
25:37.200 --> 25:38.000
It's fixed.

491
25:38.070 --> 25:39.400
Take off the leather cover tomorrow.

492
25:39.400 --> 25:40.160
How much?

493
25:40.640 --> 25:41.440
Five hundred.

494
25:42.110 --> 25:42.920
Say it again?

495
25:43.790 --> 25:44.590
Five hundred.

496
25:47.440 --> 25:48.510
I'll handle it.

497
25:49.240 --> 25:50.640
Go wait for me at the door.

498
26:01.830 --> 26:02.510
Hello?

499
26:02.510 --> 26:04.770
Didn't you say you were coming to Fuzhou?

500
26:04.880 --> 26:06.410
Why did you end up in Bengbu?

501
26:07.240 --> 26:08.200
There was a problem

502
26:08.200 --> 26:09.460
with the train I was on,

503
26:09.510 --> 26:10.770
so my trip got delayed.

504
26:12.000 --> 26:12.830
So are you still coming?

505
26:12.540 --> 26:17.210
[Guangming Guesthouse]

506
26:13.640 --> 26:14.440
I'm not.

507
26:14.830 --> 26:15.510
The hospital

508
26:15.510 --> 26:17.480
that was going to hire me changed its mind.

509
26:17.480 --> 26:18.400
Listen,

510
26:18.440 --> 26:19.400
wherever you are right now,

511
26:19.400 --> 26:21.400
get home as soon as possible. Got it?

512
26:22.510 --> 26:23.960
Then I'll come to Bengbu.

513
26:24.270 --> 26:26.070
What are you coming to Bengbu to see me for?

514
26:26.070 --> 26:28.330
I have something to say to you, of course.

515
26:28.880 --> 26:30.940
Can't you just tell me over the phone?

516
26:31.240 --> 26:32.830
Some things must be said in person.

517
26:32.830 --> 26:36.550
What could possibly be so important that you have to say it face-to-face?

518
26:36.550 --> 26:38.680
You're not going to try to talk me into going back, are you?

519
26:38.680 --> 26:40.110
Because that's not happening.

520
26:40.110 --> 26:40.830
Seriously,

521
26:40.830 --> 26:42.000
why are you being so difficult?

522
26:42.000 --> 26:44.000
I told you, we need to

523
26:44.240 --> 26:45.640
talk in person.

524
26:46.030 --> 26:47.000
Just send me your address.

525
26:47.000 --> 26:48.130
What's the big deal?

526
26:48.550 --> 26:50.010
Is that really necessary?

527
26:50.350 --> 26:51.210
Of course it is!

528
26:51.640 --> 26:52.880
I've got this suitcase here,

529
26:52.880 --> 26:54.280
and it's freaking heavy.

530
26:54.750 --> 26:55.550
I can't

531
26:56.960 --> 26:58.110
make heads or tails

532
26:58.110 --> 27:00.400
of these books,

533
27:00.190 --> 27:03.980
[Home Service]

534
27:01.480 --> 27:02.270
but

535
27:02.270 --> 27:03.670
they're all about skulls

536
27:03.920 --> 27:05.110
and skeletons and stuff.

537
27:05.110 --> 27:06.510
Must be medical books.

538
27:06.550 --> 27:08.640
There are clothes,

539
27:09.350 --> 27:10.510
some socks,

540
27:11.310 --> 27:12.590
and a few

541
27:13.550 --> 27:15.200
tiny yellow panties.

542
27:15.400 --> 27:18.480
No idea whose they are.

543
27:19.880 --> 27:21.480
They've got little bees on them.

544
27:21.480 --> 27:22.000
Wait...

545
27:24.920 --> 27:25.750
Hey, wait a minute.

546
27:25.750 --> 27:26.270
Wait a minute.

547
27:26.270 --> 27:28.750
W-What you are doing is...

548
27:28.880 --> 27:29.680
That's

549
27:30.000 --> 27:31.440
a violation of my privacy,

550
27:31.440 --> 27:32.240
you know?

551
27:32.960 --> 27:34.740
W-Why do you have my suitcase?

552
27:34.790 --> 27:35.750
Oh, it's yours?

553
27:36.200 --> 27:37.200
That makes sense.

554
27:37.550 --> 27:39.160
Didn't I go to that hospital—

555
27:39.160 --> 27:41.030
it's called Kangtaierke, right?

556
27:41.160 --> 27:42.960
They knew I was looking for you,

557
27:43.440 --> 27:45.070
so they gave me this suitcase,

558
27:45.070 --> 27:46.750
saying someone sent it by courier.

559
27:46.750 --> 27:47.270
But you still can't

560
27:47.270 --> 27:48.680
just open my suitcase.

561
27:48.880 --> 27:49.880
I had to see if there were

562
27:49.880 --> 27:52.010
any dangerous items inside, alright?

563
27:52.030 --> 27:52.830
Fine.

564
27:53.480 --> 27:55.080
You're done looking, right?

565
27:55.590 --> 27:56.480
Put everything back as it was,

566
27:56.480 --> 27:57.590
and close the suitcase for me.

567
27:57.590 --> 27:59.550
It's hard to put it back exactly as it was.

568
27:59.550 --> 28:00.510
It's too messy.

569
28:00.510 --> 28:01.000
How about I help you

570
28:01.000 --> 28:02.110
organize it properly

571
28:02.110 --> 28:02.480
later?

572
28:02.480 --> 28:04.400
I don't need your help organizing it.

573
28:04.400 --> 28:05.960
Just ship me the suitcase,

574
28:06.030 --> 28:07.240
and I'll pay the postage when it arrives.

575
28:07.240 --> 28:07.960
Sure.

576
28:08.030 --> 28:09.750
Then give me your address.

577
28:09.960 --> 28:10.790
Bengbu City,

578
28:11.960 --> 28:13.070
Dream Garden...

579
28:14.110 --> 28:15.110
No, wait a minute.

580
28:15.200 --> 28:16.720
You're tricking me, aren't you?

581
28:16.720 --> 28:17.640
If I give you the address,

582
28:17.640 --> 28:19.240
you'll come over, won't you?

583
28:21.510 --> 28:23.240
You're really something, I...

584
28:23.510 --> 28:25.310
If you don't give me the address,

585
28:25.590 --> 28:27.450
how am I supposed to ship it to you?

586
28:29.640 --> 28:30.590
Besides,

587
28:30.900 --> 28:34.640
[Guangming Guesthouse]

588
28:31.640 --> 28:32.960
am I a monster or something?

589
28:32.960 --> 28:34.240
Like I'm going to eat you.

590
28:34.240 --> 28:35.270
Trying to stop me.

591
28:35.270 --> 28:36.800
You're just unbelievable.

592
28:37.480 --> 28:39.080
Stop giving me the runaround

593
28:39.440 --> 28:40.880
and send me your address

594
28:41.070 --> 28:42.750
in a voice message.

595
28:43.000 --> 28:44.110
Every last detail!

596
28:44.110 --> 28:44.960
Quit yapping

597
28:44.960 --> 28:45.590
and just ship me my suitcase!

598
28:45.590 --> 28:46.240
Hurry up,

599
28:46.240 --> 28:46.960
get a move on,

600
28:46.960 --> 28:47.720
send it to me quickly, efficiently,

601
28:47.720 --> 28:50.250
and without any fuss! I'll be there tomorrow!

602
28:50.640 --> 28:53.700
I really had to get tough with you to make you cooperate.

603
29:03.590 --> 29:04.400
All set.

604
29:04.880 --> 29:06.210
How much did you pay him?

605
29:07.070 --> 29:08.750
We're buddies. No need to pay.

606
29:09.510 --> 29:11.270
That's not appropriate, right?

607
29:11.270 --> 29:13.130
Nothing inappropriate about it.

608
29:14.240 --> 29:15.270
What's the exact address

609
29:15.270 --> 29:16.400
of this guesthouse?

610
29:17.480 --> 29:18.940
I'll text it to you in a bit.

611
29:29.350 --> 29:31.150
Alright, alright, take a break.

612
29:31.880 --> 29:33.080
Don't you feel tired?

613
29:33.270 --> 29:34.070
I do.

614
29:34.200 --> 29:35.030
Of course you do.

615
29:35.030 --> 29:36.680
You're using the wrong muscles.

616
29:36.680 --> 29:37.540
Watch closely.

617
29:39.550 --> 29:40.680
You should be putting the force

618
29:40.680 --> 29:42.270
into your shoulders, right?

619
29:42.270 --> 29:42.960
Look.

620
29:43.680 --> 29:44.510
Let the force

621
29:44.510 --> 29:45.440
flow through your shoulders.

622
29:45.440 --> 29:46.750
See that? See that?

623
29:47.160 --> 29:49.310
We're giving a massage, not wrestling someone down,

624
29:49.310 --> 29:49.750
right?

625
29:49.750 --> 29:51.400
This way, you won't tire yourself out,

626
29:51.400 --> 29:52.750
and he'll feel better too. Got it?

627
29:52.750 --> 29:53.400
Give it a try.

628
29:53.400 --> 29:53.920
Okay.

629
29:54.200 --> 29:54.880
Right.

630
29:55.750 --> 29:57.150
Through your shoulders.

631
29:57.790 --> 29:59.390
That's right. That's right.

632
29:59.400 --> 30:01.240
Did you skip breakfast this morning?

633
30:01.240 --> 30:02.110
No, I ate.

634
30:03.200 --> 30:05.000
Then put some muscle into it.

635
30:05.000 --> 30:06.550
You're here so I can practice on you.

636
30:06.550 --> 30:07.920
You're just a prop, got it?

637
30:07.920 --> 30:09.780
Props don't get to give opinions.

638
30:12.200 --> 30:13.240
You two are something else.

639
30:13.240 --> 30:15.300
Alright, take your time practicing.

640
30:15.720 --> 30:17.180
Can I just go to sleep then?

641
30:17.680 --> 30:20.400
You dragged me over here first thing in the morning.

642
30:20.400 --> 30:21.550
I'm so sleepy.

643
30:21.550 --> 30:22.310
If you fall asleep,

644
30:22.310 --> 30:24.070
how will you know if my technique is any good?

645
30:24.070 --> 30:26.590
Falling asleep is how you know your technique is good, okay?

646
30:26.590 --> 30:28.450
It means I'm comfortable. Get it?

647
30:28.750 --> 30:29.270
Dad.

648
30:29.270 --> 30:30.070
Sweetie.

649
30:30.160 --> 30:30.960
You've had your breakfast?

650
30:30.960 --> 30:32.310
Yes, and I brought this for you.

651
30:32.310 --> 30:33.880
You even brought me something?

652
30:33.880 --> 30:36.210
I'll show you what real strength is later.

653
30:38.480 --> 30:39.720
I'll get to work then.

654
30:41.960 --> 30:43.350
Having guests so early?

655
30:44.400 --> 30:45.000
Just my buddy,

656
30:45.000 --> 30:46.400
here to help me practice.

657
30:48.510 --> 30:49.310
Your friend

658
30:49.310 --> 30:51.000
has a pretty nice voice.

659
30:51.680 --> 30:52.480
Really?

660
30:54.110 --> 30:54.790
I'm off.

661
30:57.240 --> 30:58.070
Who's that?

662
30:59.200 --> 31:00.310
Gong's daughter.

663
31:02.200 --> 31:03.510
Is she blind?

664
31:03.680 --> 31:04.680
What kind of question is that?

665
31:04.680 --> 31:05.400
It's a blind massage parlor.

666
31:05.400 --> 31:06.660
Of course she's blind.

667
31:06.960 --> 31:08.270
She's quite pretty.

668
31:11.830 --> 31:12.960
You were lying here the whole time.

669
31:12.960 --> 31:13.920
How could you tell

670
31:13.920 --> 31:15.070
whether she's pretty or not?

671
31:15.070 --> 31:16.720
All I had to do was look up.

672
31:16.920 --> 31:18.240
I've got a sharp eye.

673
31:18.960 --> 31:20.070
Oh, you do, huh?

674
31:20.590 --> 31:21.310
Whoosh!

675
31:21.400 --> 31:22.310
I'm really getting in.

676
31:22.310 --> 31:23.400
I'm really getting in there now.

677
31:23.400 --> 31:24.400
Am I getting in there?

678
31:24.400 --> 31:25.480
You tell me.

679
31:26.790 --> 31:27.480
Easy, okay?

680
31:27.480 --> 31:30.000
What's gotten into you all of a sudden? You went from 0 to 100 just like that.

681
31:30.000 --> 31:31.200
Feeling relaxed now?

682
31:32.070 --> 31:33.730
I really fell asleep in there.

683
31:33.920 --> 31:34.720
It worked.

684
31:37.720 --> 31:39.310
The New Year's coming up soon.

685
31:39.310 --> 31:40.270
How are you planning to spend it?

686
31:40.270 --> 31:41.880
I usually spend it at home.

687
31:42.240 --> 31:44.270
But now that my mother's passed away,

688
31:44.270 --> 31:45.590
I'll just spend it alone.

689
31:45.590 --> 31:46.750
Don't you still have your brother?

690
31:46.750 --> 31:47.950
Don't get me started.

691
31:47.960 --> 31:49.360
He went back to the South.

692
31:50.070 --> 31:51.000
When was that?

693
31:51.830 --> 31:52.960
A couple of days ago.

694
31:57.350 --> 31:59.030
Then let's spend the New Year together this year.

695
31:59.030 --> 32:00.630
You can come over to my place.

696
32:02.310 --> 32:03.440
I think I'll pass.

697
32:03.680 --> 32:04.240
To be honest with you,

698
32:04.240 --> 32:06.040
Director Duan kind of scares me.

699
32:08.070 --> 32:08.880
Alright.

700
32:09.400 --> 32:10.830
Go on ahead. I won't see you out.

701
32:10.830 --> 32:11.550
Bye-bye.

702
32:18.400 --> 32:20.030
What are you still hanging around for?

703
32:20.030 --> 32:21.720
Waiting to lay an egg or something?

704
32:21.720 --> 32:22.350
No.

705
32:23.400 --> 32:24.200
It's just...

706
32:25.720 --> 32:26.850
Is something wrong?

707
32:33.830 --> 32:35.200
I got fired from my job.

708
32:35.640 --> 32:36.440
Why?

709
32:36.590 --> 32:38.450
They changed the name of the place

710
32:38.480 --> 32:41.240
and started passing off heated recirculated water

711
32:41.240 --> 32:42.370
as hot spring water.

712
32:42.680 --> 32:43.680
It pissed me off,

713
32:43.720 --> 32:45.000
so I went public with it

714
32:45.000 --> 32:46.200
and told the customers.

715
32:46.200 --> 32:47.860
In the end, the boss found out.

716
32:48.750 --> 32:51.010
With the New Year just around the corner,

717
32:52.030 --> 32:52.960
could you

718
32:52.960 --> 32:54.440
lend me 2,000 yuan

719
32:54.640 --> 32:56.570
to tide me over? Would that be okay?

720
33:00.070 --> 33:02.070
I really can't come up with 2,000 yuan right now.

721
33:02.070 --> 33:02.790
Then... Then never mind.

722
33:02.790 --> 33:03.960
You know, it's because

723
33:03.960 --> 33:06.490
my mom's savings are in a fixed-term account.

724
33:06.880 --> 33:08.030
Wait until I finish this month's work,

725
33:08.030 --> 33:08.960
okay? I'll lend you the money.

726
33:08.960 --> 33:10.400
No, it's okay. Forget it.

727
33:10.400 --> 33:11.590
I'll go ask Gong

728
33:11.720 --> 33:13.160
if I can get an advance.

729
33:13.200 --> 33:14.310
I'll just get an advance a-and transfer it to you

730
33:14.310 --> 33:15.480
so you can use it for now, okay?

731
33:15.480 --> 33:16.160
That wouldn't be right.

732
33:16.160 --> 33:17.590
You're working for him now,

733
33:17.590 --> 33:19.310
and you just started. I don't want him getting the wrong idea.

734
33:19.310 --> 33:19.960
Don't worry.

735
33:19.960 --> 33:20.920
I've got plenty of buddies.

736
33:20.920 --> 33:22.510
I'll just borrow some from one of them.

737
33:22.510 --> 33:23.440
It's no big deal.

738
33:24.440 --> 33:25.160
I'm off.

739
33:25.350 --> 33:26.070
Are you sure?

740
33:26.070 --> 33:26.960
Don't worry.

741
33:42.110 --> 33:43.310
I can lend it to you.

742
33:49.880 --> 33:51.270
Are you talking to me?

743
33:51.440 --> 33:52.240
Yes.

744
33:52.720 --> 33:54.520
Didn't you want to borrow money?

745
33:55.240 --> 33:56.720
My eyesight may be bad,

746
33:56.830 --> 33:58.360
but my hearing's just fine.

747
33:58.630 --> 34:04.290
[Please Come Again]

748
34:00.680 --> 34:02.640
We just met.

749
34:02.920 --> 34:04.920
Why are you willing to lend me money?

750
34:06.590 --> 34:07.550
There's a catch.

751
34:13.219 --> 34:16.610
[New Year's Eve] [Happy New Year]

752
34:25.550 --> 34:26.360
Bro,

753
34:26.880 --> 34:28.230
who exactly are we waiting for?

754
34:28.130 --> 34:31.389
[New Year's Eve Dinner] [Make Reservations for the Spring Festival Reunion Banquet]

755
34:28.550 --> 34:30.030
An irrelevant person.

756
34:31.800 --> 34:32.880
If they're irrelevant,

757
34:32.880 --> 34:34.139
why wait for them then?

758
34:41.880 --> 34:42.670
Hello.

759
34:42.020 --> 34:44.020
[Mr. Zhou Peiyu]

760
34:42.030 --> 34:49.360
[New Year's Eve Dinner] [Make Reservations for the Spring Festival Reunion Banquet]

761
34:43.030 --> 34:43.960
I have a question.

762
34:43.960 --> 34:45.030
Can I buy a train ticket

763
34:45.030 --> 34:46.550
for someone

764
34:46.550 --> 34:48.280
if I don't know their ID number?

765
34:49.920 --> 34:51.320
Of course not.

766
34:51.670 --> 34:52.760
Without an ID,

767
34:52.960 --> 34:54.159
you can't buy a ticket

768
34:54.190 --> 34:56.110
at any train station in our country.

769
34:56.110 --> 34:56.920
Thanks.

770
35:03.440 --> 35:05.100
Who are we buying a ticket for?

771
35:05.400 --> 35:07.260
For the person we're waiting for.

772
35:07.630 --> 35:08.440
But isn't the person

773
35:08.440 --> 35:10.190
we're waiting for arriving soon?

774
35:10.190 --> 35:12.030
Yes. I want to buy her a train ticket

775
35:12.030 --> 35:13.670
so she can go back to her hometown as soon as possible.

776
35:13.670 --> 35:16.230
Sending someone back right after they arrive—

777
35:16.230 --> 35:18.160
do you owe them money or something?

778
35:18.670 --> 35:20.530
Why do you have so many questions?

779
35:23.200 --> 35:23.610
[Food]

780
35:23.680 --> 35:24.690
[Thirteen-Spice Crawfish]

781
35:24.820 --> 35:26.140
[Classic Tasting Combo: Spicy & Thirteen-Spice]

782
35:31.090 --> 35:35.030
[Exit]

783
35:39.110 --> 35:39.920
Here I am!

784
35:48.440 --> 35:50.500
I didn't expect you to come pick me up.

785
35:54.110 --> 35:54.800
Give me the suitcase,

786
35:54.800 --> 35:55.590
and you can head back.

787
35:55.590 --> 35:56.280
W-W-What?

788
35:56.510 --> 35:57.440
W-Wait a minute.

789
35:59.150 --> 36:00.810
Are you trying to get rid of me?

790
36:02.630 --> 36:04.030
You've been down south for a few days,

791
36:04.030 --> 36:05.440
and it's gone to your head, huh?

792
36:05.440 --> 36:06.760
Am I a delivery guy now?

793
36:07.000 --> 36:09.400
Just here to drop off your luggage and bags?

794
36:09.800 --> 36:10.320
Don't take it then.

795
36:10.320 --> 36:12.480
Don't shower or change your clothes, either.

796
36:12.480 --> 36:14.010
You're just unbelievable.

797
36:14.150 --> 36:14.880
Didn't you have something

798
36:14.880 --> 36:16.190
to say to me in person?

799
36:16.400 --> 36:18.000
Spit it out so you can go home.

800
36:18.400 --> 36:19.190
I do have something to say,

801
36:19.190 --> 36:20.030
but how can I say it here?

802
36:20.030 --> 36:21.480
Why can't you say it here?

803
36:21.710 --> 36:22.880
Since when do we need a special place to talk?

804
36:22.880 --> 36:24.000
Of course we do.

805
36:24.480 --> 36:27.080
Would you propose to someone at a funeral home?

806
36:27.400 --> 36:28.710
What, am I wrong?

807
36:30.030 --> 36:31.400
What a buzzkill.

808
36:32.710 --> 36:33.770
Welcome. Welcome.

809
36:34.000 --> 36:34.710
Sis.

810
36:35.190 --> 36:37.510
Well, is this your first time in Bengbu?

811
36:37.840 --> 36:39.280
Yes, and you are?

812
36:39.710 --> 36:40.510
I...

813
36:41.670 --> 36:44.280
I'm Zhengliang's underling, Zhou Zheng!

814
36:45.230 --> 36:46.880
Zhou Zheng as in handsome.

815
36:51.510 --> 36:52.920
J-Just call me Pink Hair.

816
36:53.670 --> 36:55.150
Is "Pink Hair" even a name?

817
36:56.070 --> 36:57.550
I-I thought it was your zodiac year.

818
36:57.550 --> 36:58.590
My name is Ai Chen.

819
36:58.590 --> 36:59.480
Ai as in moxibustion,

820
36:59.480 --> 37:00.840
Chen as in birth time.

821
37:01.510 --> 37:03.030
Nice to meet you.

822
37:03.070 --> 37:04.200
Nice to meet you too.

823
37:04.590 --> 37:05.000
Here,

824
37:05.000 --> 37:05.920
let me help you with that luggage.

825
37:05.920 --> 37:08.050
T-This isn't mine. It's your buddy's.

826
37:08.150 --> 37:09.280
He's not my buddy,

827
37:09.320 --> 37:10.280
nor is he yours.

828
37:13.320 --> 37:15.000
Always talking nonsense like that.

829
37:15.000 --> 37:15.800
What an attitude.

830
37:15.800 --> 37:16.800
Sis, where's your luggage?

831
37:16.800 --> 37:17.960
I don't have any luggage.

832
37:17.960 --> 37:19.320
T-This is all his.

833
37:19.670 --> 37:21.400
You came from the Northeast without any luggage?

834
37:21.400 --> 37:22.480
Exactly.

835
37:22.710 --> 37:24.230
I was in a rush.

836
37:24.360 --> 37:25.320
I just arrived in Fuzhou

837
37:25.320 --> 37:27.230
from Fucheng yesterday.

838
37:27.550 --> 37:28.110
And today,

839
37:28.110 --> 37:29.280
I hurried over here.

840
37:30.070 --> 37:32.280
It's fine. I'll just buy whatever I need.

841
37:32.280 --> 37:33.410
Sis, you're so cool.

842
37:34.280 --> 37:36.740
Let me treat you to some Bengbu specialties.

843
37:36.800 --> 37:38.440
I just bought a group voucher.

844
37:38.440 --> 37:39.280
It's a great deal.

845
37:39.280 --> 37:40.760
I'm starving, you know?

846
37:40.760 --> 37:42.320
I was on the road for 7 hours

847
37:42.320 --> 37:43.400
and didn't eat anything.

848
37:43.400 --> 37:44.320
Perfect timing then.

849
37:44.320 --> 37:45.280
I disagree.

850
37:46.590 --> 37:47.920
Alright, bro. Then we're going alone.

851
37:47.920 --> 37:50.320
Who asked him? Like we need his permission.

852
37:55.440 --> 37:56.280
It's so flavorful.

853
37:56.230 --> 38:04.750
[Culinary Delights Along the Huai River] [Street Food Stalls and Vibrant Life]

854
37:57.800 --> 37:58.360
Isn't it?

855
37:58.480 --> 37:59.320
So tasty.

856
38:02.440 --> 38:03.230
Sis,

857
38:04.230 --> 38:05.230
you're so pretty.

858
38:06.880 --> 38:08.410
You're such a sweet talker.

859
38:09.670 --> 38:11.630
I should be the one treating this time.

860
38:11.630 --> 38:13.960
He already bought the voucher on Meituan.

861
38:14.590 --> 38:16.550
Then I'll treat next time.

862
38:17.920 --> 38:18.630
Sis,

863
38:21.590 --> 38:23.120
be my girlfriend, will you?

864
38:27.320 --> 38:28.440
You're a bit too young.

865
38:28.440 --> 38:29.670
We've got a huge age gap.

866
38:29.670 --> 38:30.960
What era are we in?

867
38:32.070 --> 38:33.600
Age is not an issue anymore.

868
38:33.880 --> 38:34.800
That's true.

869
38:36.440 --> 38:37.230
But

870
38:37.230 --> 38:39.290
I've already fallen for Zhengliang.

871
38:43.110 --> 38:44.190
I knew it.

872
38:45.760 --> 38:46.510
I could tell.

873
38:46.760 --> 38:49.030
Are you two dating?

874
38:49.510 --> 38:51.230
No. He hasn't agreed to it yet.

875
38:51.800 --> 38:52.550
Wait, bro.

876
38:52.760 --> 38:54.230
Y-You haven't agreed?

877
38:54.230 --> 38:55.000
Exactly.

878
38:55.000 --> 38:56.800
He's got a psychological issue.

879
38:58.760 --> 38:59.920
Am I wrong?

880
39:01.280 --> 39:06.150
[Culinary Delights Along the Huai River] [Street Food Stalls and Vibrant Life]

881
39:05.800 --> 39:06.550
I get it.

882
39:07.320 --> 39:08.590
Well, bro.

883
39:09.510 --> 39:11.710
Don't worry, ED is treatable nowadays.

884
39:13.360 --> 39:15.160
Want me to knock your lights out?

885
39:17.000 --> 39:19.600
No, no, no. That's not the kind of issue I meant.

886
39:20.070 --> 39:21.550
He... His issue's even more serious than that?

887
39:21.550 --> 39:22.360
I'll go check

888
39:22.440 --> 39:24.360
why the drinks from our combo aren't here yet.

889
39:24.360 --> 39:25.550
He got embarrassed.

890
39:27.110 --> 39:27.840
What,

891
39:27.840 --> 39:29.070
it's even m-more serious than that?

892
39:29.070 --> 39:30.110
Stop guessing.

893
39:30.670 --> 39:32.510
Well, that's his privacy.

894
39:32.800 --> 39:34.000
Let him tell you himself later,

895
39:34.000 --> 39:34.550
okay?

896
39:39.280 --> 39:40.340
Look how much I ate.

897
39:41.280 --> 39:42.150
So delicious.

898
39:45.840 --> 39:47.590
Zhengliang's quite weird.

899
39:48.590 --> 39:49.360
I-I can do it myself.

900
39:49.360 --> 39:50.150
Thanks.

901
39:50.670 --> 39:51.510
I heard

902
39:51.630 --> 39:53.000
he has a younger brother in the Northeast.

903
39:53.000 --> 39:54.600
You mean Zhengguang, right?

904
39:55.070 --> 39:56.150
These two brothers

905
39:57.280 --> 39:59.630
don't get along well in terms of personality,

906
39:59.630 --> 40:00.830
so they always fight.

907
40:02.000 --> 40:03.960
Then does Zhengliang have any friends?

908
40:03.960 --> 40:04.960
Of course he does.

909
40:06.550 --> 40:08.150
Although he's a bit avoidant,

910
40:08.150 --> 40:09.360
he's quite reliable.

911
40:09.400 --> 40:11.130
He still has a few good friends.

912
40:12.440 --> 40:13.400
Don't drink alone.

913
40:13.400 --> 40:14.660
Let's drink together.

914
40:18.880 --> 40:19.670
Sis, well...

915
40:20.070 --> 40:21.150
You eat first.

916
40:21.190 --> 40:22.150
I ran into an acquaintance.

917
40:22.150 --> 40:22.760
I'll go say hi.

918
40:22.760 --> 40:23.510
Go ahead.

919
40:23.510 --> 40:25.440
Don't mind me. It's okay. Go ahead.

920
40:31.550 --> 40:32.360
Ms. Xia?

921
40:33.920 --> 40:34.710
Ms. Xia.

922
40:35.960 --> 40:36.760
Zhou Zheng?

923
40:38.880 --> 40:40.320
How did you turn out like this?

924
40:40.320 --> 40:41.800
D-Don't I look

925
40:41.960 --> 40:44.070
way more handsome than I did back in school?

926
40:44.070 --> 40:46.400
I thought you'd gone back to repeat a year.

927
40:46.670 --> 40:47.800
I never expected...

928
40:48.190 --> 40:50.520
Isn't the point of studying to make money?

929
40:51.150 --> 40:53.750
And isn't the point of making money to be happy?

930
40:53.840 --> 40:54.630
You know,

931
40:54.960 --> 40:56.760
you can't put a price on doing what you want.

932
40:56.760 --> 40:57.710
As long as I'm happy...

933
40:57.710 --> 40:58.360
What's going on?

934
40:58.360 --> 40:59.150
Isn't that like

935
40:59.150 --> 40:59.840
I'm getting a head start on making money?

936
40:59.840 --> 41:00.760
I heard him call her "teacher".

937
41:00.760 --> 41:02.510
Who did you learn all this from?

938
41:03.590 --> 41:04.800
From you.

939
41:05.320 --> 41:06.380
You taught me that.

940
41:06.550 --> 41:08.080
You pushed me into society,

941
41:08.510 --> 41:09.960
and society taught me that,

942
41:09.960 --> 41:10.590
right?

943
41:13.550 --> 41:14.760
Ms. Xia, well,

944
41:15.550 --> 41:16.760
enjoy your meal.

945
41:16.760 --> 41:18.000
This meal is on me.

946
41:19.000 --> 41:19.920
Enjoy your meal.

947
41:19.920 --> 41:20.960
Alright, alright.

948
41:20.960 --> 41:22.820
He's really thrown his life away.

949
41:41.190 --> 41:42.000
Ms. Xia.

950
41:42.110 --> 41:43.280
W-What did you just say?

951
41:43.280 --> 41:44.680
I-I didn't hear clearly.

952
41:45.360 --> 41:46.630
S-Say it again.

953
41:47.880 --> 41:49.150
Sorry. Sorry.

954
41:49.630 --> 41:50.800
Sit down.

955
41:50.960 --> 41:51.960
Say it again.

956
42:14.630 --> 42:15.890
That was your teacher?

957
42:16.000 --> 42:17.800
Yeah, my former homeroom teacher.

958
42:17.800 --> 42:19.200
Totally irresponsible.

959
42:21.070 --> 42:21.880
Is that so?

960
42:23.960 --> 42:24.590
You don't necessarily have to go to school

961
42:24.590 --> 42:25.800
to get ahead in life,

962
42:27.440 --> 42:28.240
but education

963
42:28.440 --> 42:30.040
is definitely the best path.

964
42:32.470 --> 42:33.280
Sure.

965
42:35.150 --> 42:36.750
For ordinary people, maybe.

966
42:38.710 --> 42:39.670
But who am I?

967
42:42.760 --> 42:45.000
I'm the chosen one.

968
42:46.230 --> 42:47.030
Right?

969
42:47.840 --> 42:48.670
Right?

970
42:48.920 --> 42:49.840
The chosen one!

971
42:50.480 --> 42:53.000
Well, sis, bro,

972
42:53.400 --> 42:56.000
you wouldn't happen to

973
42:56.000 --> 42:58.000
look down on me for not graduating high school, right?

974
42:58.000 --> 42:59.110
How could I?

975
42:59.880 --> 43:01.360
I actually look up to you.

976
43:02.190 --> 43:03.670
I didn't even graduate elementary school.

977
43:03.670 --> 43:05.150
I couldn't tell.

978
43:06.280 --> 43:07.710
I don't hit people in the face, right?

979
43:07.710 --> 43:08.360
Yes.

980
43:08.400 --> 43:09.400
Well, Doctor,

981
43:10.030 --> 43:10.800
here's to education!

982
43:10.800 --> 43:12.630
To education! Come on, cheers!
